      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "To give the topic the time it deserves, I’m making “The art of the pivot” a two-part series. For part one (this post), I’ve spent the past few weeks combing through my podcast episodes, newsletters, and online interviews to put together",
      "parent": {
