      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/16",
      "text": "A few surprising takeaways:"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "enumerated": true,
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "list_item",
      "marker": "",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Companies only pivot into B2B, never out of it. B2B startups stay in B2B. No one I’ve come across has pivoted from B2B to B2C successfully.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/17",
      "text": "Companies only pivot into B2B, never out of it. B2B startups stay in B2B. No one I’ve come across has pivoted from B2B to B2C successfully."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "enumerated": true,
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "list_item",
      "marker": "",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "A fourth of companies pivoted less than three months after launching their initial product. The median time was one year. Notion took four years, and Lyft took five.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/18",
      "text": "A fourth of companies pivoted less than three months after launching their initial product. The median time was one year. Notion took four years, and Lyft took five."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "enumerated": true,
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "list_item",
      "marker": "",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "Many pivots kept nothing from the original idea, counter to Eric Ries’s advice to “keep one foot in the past and place one foot in a new possible future.”",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/19",
      "text": "Many pivots kept nothing from the original idea, counter to Eric Ries’s advice to “keep one foot in the past and place one foot in a new possible future.”"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "enumerated": true,
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "list_item",
      "marker": "",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "That being said, the majority of pivots emerged from founders narrowing their focus to a single feature or piece of tech that was showing pull.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/20",
      "text": "That being said, the majority of pivots emerged from founders narrowing their focus to a single feature or piece of tech that was showing pull."
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "enumerated": true,
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "list_item",
      "marker": "",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "A surprising number of successful pivots (over a fourth of this list!) came from finding pull for a piece of tech the team built for themselves while building their original, unrelated, business.",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/2"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/21",
      "text": "A surprising number of successful pivots (over a fourth of this list!) came from finding pull for a piece of tech the team built for themselves while building their original, unrelated, business."
    },
